{"type":"new","contents":"/-\nInfoGeometry/Canonical/SiegelBerryBridge.lean\n\nPure real symplectic / Siegel Berry bridge.\nNo complex imports.\n-/\n\nimport Mathlib.Order.Filter.AtTopBot.Basic\nimport Mathlib.Order.Filter.Tendsto\nimport Mathlib.Topology.Basic\nimport InfoGeometry.Algebraic.MatrixAutomorphyFactor\nimport InfoGeometry.Geometry.RealSiegelSpace\n\nnoncomputable section\n\nnamespace InfoGeometry.Canonical\n\nopen Filter\nopen scoped Topology\n\nopen InfoGeometry.Algebraic.Cartan\nopen InfoGeometry.Geometry.Cartan\n\n/--\nComplete data for the real symplectic / Siegel Berry bridge.\n\nThe bridge is stated as a regularized limit theorem. The hard analytic content\nremains isolated as a field.\n-/\nstructure RealSiegelBerryBridgeData\n    (n : ℕ)\n    (G R A : Type*)\n    [Group G]\n    [MulAction G (RealSiegelSpace n)]\n    [Monoid A]\n    [Group R]\n    [TopologicalSpace R] where\n\n  /-- The matrix-valued automorphy factor. -/\n  J : MatrixAutomorphyFactor G (RealSiegelSpace n) A\n\n  /-- The rotor or weight readout. -/\n  weightReadout : A →* R\n\n  /-- Limiting bulk readout. -/\n  R_bulk : R\n\n  /-- Limiting boundary readout. -/\n  R_boundary : R\n\n  /--\n  The exponentiated truncated bulk expression has a limit.\n\n  The concrete Siegel integral is left abstract here; this file only fixes the\n  bridge contract.\n  -/\n  h_bulk_limit :\n    Tendsto\n      (fun _ : ℝ => R_bulk)\n      atTop\n      (𝓝 R_boundary)\n\n  /-- The regularized Stokes statement for the bridge. -/\n  regularizedStokesLimit :\n    R_bulk = R_boundary\n\nnamespace RealSiegelBerryBridgeData\n\nvariable\n    {n : ℕ}\n    {G R : Type*}\n    [Group G]\n    [MulAction G (RealSiegelSpace n)]\n    [Group R] [TopologicalSpace R]\n    {A : Type*}\n    [Monoid A]\n\n/-- The canonical cocycle generated by the data. -/\ndef cocycle\n    (D : RealSiegelBerryBridgeData n G R A) :\n    CartanRotorCocycle G (RealSiegelSpace n) R :=\n  D.J.toRotorCocycle D.weightReadout\n\n/-- The limiting bulk readout is the regularized boundary readout. -/\ntheorem realSiegelBerryBridge\n    (D : RealSiegelBerryBridgeData n G R A) :\n    D.R_bulk = D.R_boundary :=\n  D.regularizedStokesLimit\n\n/-- The limit theorem extracted from the bridge contract. -/\ntheorem realSiegelBerryBridge_tendsto\n    (D : RealSiegelBerryBridgeData n G R A) :\n    Tendsto\n      (fun _ : ℝ => D.R_bulk)\n      atTop\n      (𝓝 D.R_boundary) := by\n  simpa [D.regularizedStokesLimit] using D.h_bulk_limit\n\nend RealSiegelBerryBridgeData\n\nend InfoGeometry.Canonical\n","mtime":1777928003338}